  "description": "U-Hyeon’s life isn’t great, but it isn’t terrible either. Sure his boss gives him a hard time, but he’s got a stable corporate job that pays the bills. He can’t exactly remember what made him fall for his boyfriend, Seok-Il, but hey, he’s handsome. But when U-Hyeon bumps into his high school love, Min-Hyeok, he realizes that the magnetic spark is still there, even after a decade. And for the first time in a long time, U-Hyeon feels totally alive.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US, edited)",
